+   convention each one still saved and restored up to eight general registers and ten XMM registers it used (8-12% of the
+   game threads' samples lay in those prologues and epilogues). A64_CC is on every lifted function (the lift writes it:
+   a64_lift.py), on A64Fn and on the four dispatchers below; host functions keep the platform's convention, so a hooked
